// Every story variable is declared here, once, for the whole game.
// Copy this file to dialogue/Variables.yarn. Add a line (with a comment) when you add a variable.
// Naming: $<thread>_<what>, snake_case, e.g. $mom_trust. Use $story_<what> for things not tied to one person.

title: Variables
---
<<declare $mom_trust = 3>>             // placeholder: how much Mom trusts the player (0-5)
<<declare $mom_l1_answered = false>>   // placeholder: did the player answer Mom in level 1?
===
